      "statement": "--ra CloudCAS creates a GCP CA pool (prompts for name, org, resource id, project, location, CA pool, DevOps/Enterprise tier, optional GCS bucket) or uses an existing certificateAuthorities resource name with --credentials-file; --ra StepCAS collects a https CA URL, 64-hex root fingerprint, and JWK provisioner name and sets IsCAGetter with a JWK CertificateIssuer, fetching the root from the remote CA.",
