    {
      "id": "claim_6979caa2f72242c698d6d3690b0a259d",
      "statement": "With --kms azurekms, step ca init collects KMS URIs for the root, intermediate, and (with --ssh) SSH host and user keys via kms.New and passes them as pki.WithKMS plus pki.WithKeyURIs.",
