    {
      "id": "claim_9e59b1f211fc4fda9fe303d63c2d3568",
      "statement": "Deployment types are standalone, linked, and hosted (RA mode only standalone/linked); hosted prints a pointer to create a Smallstep account and run step ca bootstrap --team, then returns without generating anything; a non-interactive standalone is assumed when all required flags are present (name/password-file, or issuer flags per RA type, plus dns/address/provisioner unless --pki).",
      "evidence": [
