    {
      "id": "claim_b0da8649af20444da095dab5399b11d7",
      "statement": "OfflineCA.Sign authorizes the OTT and signs the CSR in-process returning the chain, CaPEM, and the authority TLSOptions, while OfflineCA.GenerateToken reuses the online per-provisioner generators with the provisioner list from ca.json, treating any non-OIDC/X5C/SSHPOP/Nebula/K8sSA/cloud/ACME/SCEP provisioner as JWK and still erroring for ACME/SCEP token flows.",
